      "slug": "cheating-prevention",
      "question": "How do you prevent cheating?",
      "answer": "Every prize-bearing score comes from a proctored sitting only. Remote tests are AI-proctored — camera, screen and response-time forensics — and there are in-person Saturday sittings during the season plus in-person proctored finals for the largest prizes.\n\nNo prize is tied to a pre/post delta, so there is no baseline worth tanking. A child who deliberately scored badly early would gain nothing, because improvement is never what the money pays on.\n\nThe Effort Grand counts only Timeback XP earned on mastered work, telemetry-audited before payout, and Verified Grade Level bounties require a proctored mastery exam. The programme publishes a methodology memo and says it invites audits.",
